Origin and credit
-----------------
jaffle_shop.duckdb is the database built by the dbt sample project
duckcode-ai/jaffle-shop-duckdb at commit
a9ec27779995708d961a6cfcad9ee5c049573e6e
(https://github.com/duckcode-ai/jaffle-shop-duckdb), using its dbt models and
seed data. scripts/rebuild-warehouse.sh repeats that build.

jaffle-shop-duckdb is in turn based on "Jaffle Shop", the open-source dbt
sandbox project of a fictional sandwich shop by dbt Labs
(https://github.com/dbt-labs/jaffle-shop). The Jaffle Shop name, the shop's
story, its seed data and the shape of the staging and mart models come from
that project. Thanks to dbt Labs and its contributors.

The seed rows (and so the rows in this database) were produced by dbt Labs'
jaffle-shop-generator (https://github.com/dbt-labs/jaffle-shop-generator),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Note: dbt-labs/jaffle-shop does not carry a licence file; jaffle-shop-duckdb
is published under the MIT licence. This repository contains no dbt project
files, only the database built from jaffle-shop-duckdb and a ZLens workspace.

ZLens (https://github.com/duckcode-ai-labs/zlens) is a separate project,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It is installed from npm
(@zlens/cli) and is not included in this repository.
